ener` Javadoc] for more information.","+"," [[batch-retry]]"," == Retry with Batch Listeners"," "],"additions":3,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"src/reference/antora/modules/ROOT/pages/whats-new.adoc","lines":["@@ -33,3 +33,9 @@ See xref:rabbitmq-amqp-client.adoc#amqp-client-routing-connection-factory[Routin"," A new `RestClientNodeLocator` is now the default non-reactive `NodeLocator` implementation for the `LocalizedQueueConnectionFactory`."," The `RestTemplateNodeLocator` is deprecated since the `RestTemplate` is deprecated in Spring Framework `7.1`."," See xref:amqp/connections.adoc#queue-affinity[Queue Affinity and the `LocalizedQueueConnectionFactory`] for more information.","+","+[[x42-stateless-retry-listener]]","+=== `RetryListener` on Stateless Retry Interceptor","+","+The `StatelessRetryOperationsInterceptor` (and its `StatelessRetryOperationsInterceptorFactoryBean`) now supports registering a `RetryListener` .","+See xref:amqp/resilience-recovering-from-errors-and-broker-failures.adoc#retry[Failures in Synchronous Operations and Options for Retry] for more information.",""],"additions":6,"deletions":0,"truncated":false}],"additions":174,"deletions":5,"truncated":false,"file_count":7},"error":null,"fetched_at":"2026-09-09T13:48:19.138936+00:00"}